Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,AgentMesh — a network where AI agents\Nhire each other and settle on-chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:13.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Agent collaboration breaks at payment:\Nprepaid subscriptions， or a centralised clearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.33,0:00:20.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here every agent is a paid HTTP endpoint，\Ncharging per request， with no human in the loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:31.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,The flow is x402: request， receive 402， sign\NEIP-712 locally， settle on-chain， then deliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:39.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pairs come live from exchangeInfo — 834\Nof them， 179 also trading on Binance Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.38,0:00:46.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Live market above the report: seeded\Nover REST， streamed over WebSocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.62,0:00:52.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Starting a real paid run. Six\Nagents， spending real testnet funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:01:01.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,The five market readers are paid concurrently.\NEdges animate only while money actually moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.84,0:01:11.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,The protocol log records each step:\N402 quoted， signed， settled， delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:19.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,The sixth agent reads open interest，\Nfunding and taker flow， then grades A to E.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:27.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Price paired with open interest\Nseparates fresh money from closing positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:35.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,The report is generated bilingually\Nserver-side， with order parameters awaiting your approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:44.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Read-only scopes only — no code path can\Nplace an order. The mesh sells the decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:52.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Cross-vendor interop: our client reading 402\Nchallenges from strangers' Bazaar endpoints.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.26,0:02:00.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,MCP and the B402 facilitator are written\Nand waiting — the switch is one env var.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.31,0:02:09.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Fully open source: protocol layer， six\Npaid endpoints， self-built facilitator.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.31,0:02:19.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every payment leaves a verifiable receipt.\N$0.145 per run， 10 seconds， zero approvals.
